OL,3,GNEWSA'Cruel and wicked' pensioner
OL,4,Ajailed for abusing children over 29
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA "cruel and wicked" pensioner who
OL,8,Fsexually assaulted a boy and subjected
OL,9,Ffour other youngsters to physical
OL,10,Fattacks over 29 years has been jailed.
OL,12,FArchibald Thorburn, 77, preyed on the
OL,13,Fyoungsters while they were in care at
OL,14,Flocations in Edinburgh.
OL,16,FThe High Court in Edinburgh heard how
OL,17,Fhe started abusing his first victim in
OL,18,Fthe summer of 1963 and continued to do
OL,19,Fso for nearly 30 years.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
